wg-contractor-underground = Underground
wg-contractor-underground-desc = The black market's own work: freight to lift, goods to bring in and scores to settle, paid in thalers.
wg-contractor-underground-employer = the Godfather (Underground members only)

wg-contract-ug-hauler-lift = Lift a hauler
wg-contract-ug-hauler-lift-brief = {$target} is hauling freight it never paid for, about {$km} km from {$home}. Take the ship; the market will sell what is in its hold. Underground only.
wg-contract-ug-undercut = Undercutting the market
wg-contract-ug-undercut-brief = {$target} has been selling on our ground without paying the Godfather's cut, and is about {$km} km from {$home}. Put it out of business. Underground only.
wg-contract-ug-hunter = Hunter on the trail
wg-contract-ug-hunter-brief = {$target} has been collecting warrants on our people and was last seen about {$km} km from {$home}. See that the next warrant goes unclaimed. Underground only.
wg-contract-ug-contraband = Crates from Camelot
wg-contract-ug-contraband-brief = A Camelot fence has {$count} crates waiting at {$origin} with the wrong labels on them. Haul them {$km} km to {$destination} without the Commissariat looking inside.
wg-contract-ug-takings = Collect the takings
wg-contract-ug-takings-brief = A strongbox of takings is waiting at {$origin} for whoever knows to ask for it. Bring it {$km} km to {$destination}, and don't let the Marshals see you carry it.
wg-contract-ug-stock = Stock for the market
wg-contract-ug-stock-brief = The stalls are running low. Bring {$goods}, packed in the manifest crate and closed aboard {$destination}.
